 filed since January 1, 2025), so their status shows as not recorded.","Each councilor's votes and office spending are not included on this site: the City Council's open data system (SAPL) does not publish individual votes or spending.","We found no bills sent by the mayor's office since January 1, 2025 in this City Council's SAPL system (no \"Executive\" or \"Mayor\" author), so the mayor's profile does not list them.","This City Council's SAPL system records no veto since January 1, 2025. Since there is no way to tell whether there was no veto or it was not recorded, the mayor's profile does not show the number of vetoes."],"conferido":"2026-10-26"}},"atualizado":"2026-10-15","onde":{"camara":{"site":"https://sapl.trindade.pe.leg.br/","sistema":"sapl","api":"https://sapl.trindade.pe.leg.br/api/","propostas":"https://sapl.trindade.pe.leg.br/materia/pesquisar-materia","propostasOnline":true,"sic":null,"conferido":"2026-10-23","motivo":null,"motivo_en":null},"prefeitura":{"site":"https://trindade.pe.gov.br/","transparencia":"https://trindade.pe.gov.br/portal-da-transparencia/","sic":"https://trindade.pe.gov.br/portal-da-transparencia/esic/","diarioOficial":{"nome":"Diário Oficial do Município de Trindade","url":"https://trindade.pe.gov.br/diario-oficial-2026","plataforma":"Própria (site oficial)"},"conferido":"2026-10-23"}}}
